    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"8a0e25ab-d0dd-42fa-b689-4b579f36aa55\" ac:macro-id=\"99f96925-e670-43f5-b601-f90727f40cbc\"\u003e\u003cac:parameter ac:name=\"style\"\u003enone\u003c/ac:parameter\u003e\u003c/ac:structured-macro\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"838a9edf1d7a\"\u003eAbbreviations\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"e2460939-1150-41bb-9a60-15b6ce33e2f6\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr ac:local-id=\"271f4969-c5dc-4119-8763-b322f8a76b43\"\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"0a1a3997-2891-4aff-b1e0-575dbb1cc379\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0071faa34bfa\"\u003eUIC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"ddd22aeb-575d-4583-9225-9dcbf83baf84\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6365450e1129\"\u003eUnique Identification Code of a customer, equal to Customer Identifier in Phoenix\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"796b036db975\"\u003eBusiness Need \u0026amp; Purpose\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"7a3f2fe4e4f2\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a\u003c/strong\u003e customer of Energo-Pro Sales or Energo-Pro Energy services,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5213b3bf3257\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want to\u003c/strong\u003e see a list of all my liabilities,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0a05f75b151a\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that\u003c/strong\u003e I can easily access details of individual liabilities or pay all open ones in bulk\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2c5e79cc197c\" /\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"feccab83d1a1\"\u003eBusiness Flow Fit (Trigger \u0026amp; Outcome)\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6da07ab833b2\"\u003eThe story is relevant for the Customer Portal. Customer logs in and navigates to the \u0026ldquo;Invoices and Payments\u0026rdquo; section, where the list of liabilities is displayed\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"88e0931ae354\" /\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"bf7c5bb8ec8f\"\u003eRequest Parameters\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2cb11e559c63\"\u003eRequest Type: \u003cstrong\u003eGET\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"934e98365402\"\u003eEndpoint: \u003cstrong\u003e/liability/list{customer_UIC}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1c033255ecf4\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"01d955d07fc8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePagination:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"57813ed7-8127-40ab-a5f1-f46fe00f7982\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"fe2a56e4-7e7a-4919-94dc-751c7368cabf\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"37c0b25c7ea8\"\u003ePage \u0026ndash; Which page to return\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5fbff0ff-9478-41aa-965e-ce1bd9faeaae\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f5467e783001\"\u003eSize \u0026ndash; How may entries per page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"f17757d6-147e-49fb-b090-fada1861920b\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0c16b9a4b21c\"\u003eColumns \u0026ndash; What attribute to sort by, can be ID, Occurrence Date, Due date, Billing group, PODid(Database ID), Initial amount, Current amount\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"a8e8d9bb-06d6-4d8a-9854-fe341b644ffa\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"100bdeb4d77c\"\u003eDirection \u0026ndash; Order of sorting, can be ASC or DESC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"424ecc86c6e7\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBilingual logic:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"7c9f4ccc-8041-45ae-9a86-1d9b7448c574\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5a4a2bd4-fefe-4496-a587-514f693df11d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"ccdfb0e3ddd1\"\u003eThe language parameter could have two values: Bulgarian and English\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"fbce2397-cbf0-4742-8082-ca14ebb717c7\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4733abc5-c327-46b5-8510-9173961fbdbe\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a33133e0652f\"\u003eIf the request is sent with the Bulgarian language parameter, we should return the default values ââin the response.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"680d629f-3899-4622-bf3f-0fb7fb9beb50\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4b33fdad-17fe-4443-91ad-0f2d4b6cde93\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d68b261cfa93\"\u003eIf the request is sent with the English language parameter, we should return the \u0026quot;transliterated\u0026quot; values ââin the response\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"4c748e4a-ec14-4116-9823-4aebd286523a\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"422457ca-ea6b-4d09-a17e-d2f336f1b122\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e0e2febe4f9f\"\u003eThe language parameter is optional in request\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"a337f439-e1b7-4270-912a-c855c410966b\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"58525480-7472-4473-995c-ea5a383c1414\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c9171c384b96\"\u003eIf the language parameter is not specified in the request, we should return the default values.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"dc967a1c-bec2-4e92-95ae-aa42a047b8c7\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"beac187d-9fe6-4e09-9d83-9b3f675c7692\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a22d83fae8e4\"\u003eIf the language parameter is specified in the request, but we don\u0026rsquo;t have transliterated value for those nomenclatures, we should return the default value\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"b55059b8-0e48-4389-8913-216591ecc4d9\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"e24d4426-2b10-44aa-a0bf-95d4ace22191\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4df25fc1cbfe\"\u003eIf the language parameter is specified in the request, we have transliterated field for that nomenclature but it\u0026rsquo;s empty, we should return the default value\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"ceee92fab2e3\" /\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"7e964f98a874\"\u003eResponse Parameters\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"80619211c949\"\u003eWhen the list is retrieved, Phoenix should return a JSON with the following attributes of all selected liabilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d07cf324d5c2\" /\u003e\u003ctable data-table-width=\"760\" data-layout=\"center\" ac:local-id=\"197fc179-6b4f-4b5d-9ac7-6f0eab5238ee\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr ac:local-id=\"a135da9243ed\"\u003e\u003cth ac:local-id=\"e7e864cc2e3c\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"95446fed995a\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eName\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth ac:local-id=\"f91becea05c3\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"841da42f8075\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponse BG\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth ac:local-id=\"5c35a28f35ca\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"da691655dba8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponse ENG\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth ac:local-id=\"7d35eeaef156\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d8bb5bc82046\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBusiness Meaning\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth ac:local-id=\"f6fed11d8f72\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c1241b6d3ba3\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLogic\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr ac:local-id=\"e1a36bf92f0c\"\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"38eb46f66abc\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"3362276a0e7b\"\u003eID\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"0506876d3b21\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b806a0ac1de5\"\u003eDefault Value\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"8632272360e4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"57cb3fa835d8\"\u003eDefault Value\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"944e6b291e58\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"110856d2361b\"\u003eLiability ID from Phoenix\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"e5bd22b6ee24\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"acdbc72694cb\" /\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr ac:local-id=\"9fbae58664ef\"\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"eab66c3aa9df\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"7acbb5417382\"\u003eType \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"f4272c21d313\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"fcc8f651092d\"\u003eDefault Value\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd ac:local-id=\"4c70