gger\u0026amp;Outcome)\"\u003eBusiness Flow Fit (Trigger \u0026amp; Outcome)\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6da07ab833b2\"\u003eThe story is relevant for the Customer Portal. Customer logs in and navigates to the âInvoices and Paymentsâ section, where the list of liabilities is displayed\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"88e0931ae354\" /\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"bf7c5bb8ec8f\" id=\"GetLiabilityListbyCustomerID-RequestParameters\"\u003eRequest Parameters\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2cb11e559c63\"\u003eRequest Type: \u003cstrong\u003eGET\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"934e98365402\"\u003eEndpoint: \u003cstrong\u003e/liability/list{customer_UIC}\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1c033255ecf4\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"01d955d07fc8\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePagination:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"57813ed7-8127-40ab-a5f1-f46fe00f7982\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"fe2a56e4-7e7a-4919-94dc-751c7368cabf\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"37c0b25c7ea8\"\u003ePage â Which page to return\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5fbff0ff-9478-41aa-965e-ce1bd9faeaae\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f5467e783001\"\u003eSize â How may entries per page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"f17757d6-147e-49fb-b090-fada1861920b\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0c16b9a4b21c\"\u003eColumns â What attribute to sort by, can be ID, Occurrence Date, Due date, Billing group, PODid(Database ID), Initial amount, Current amount\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"a8e8d9bb-06d6-4d8a-9854-fe341b644ffa\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"100bdeb4d77c\"\u003eDirection â Order of sorting, can be ASC or DESC\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"424ecc86c6e7\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBilingual logic:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"7c9f4ccc-8041-45ae-9a86-1d9b7448c574\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5a4a2bd4-fefe-4496-a587-514f693df11d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"ccdfb0e3ddd1\"\u003eThe language